{"4668470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "hexGame: Hero Path", "steam_appid": 4668470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4769880], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world awaits a hero — choose your own.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any NPC can become the chosen one. Explore a living, procedurally generated hex-based world, forge your own path, build unique combinations of weapons, tools, and relics, and crush hordes of enemies in fast-paced combat.  No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set out on a journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world full of secrets and random encounters, inspired by classic RPGs.  Five distinct biomes, each with its own visual style and enemies, make every journey unpredictable. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/eba13514614a1de7a895d965bf6696e3.avif?t=1787756734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras_big/eba13514614a1de7a895d965bf6696e3.avif?t=1787756734 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique cities and villages, filled with quirky inhabitants and their own stories. Take on small tasks, play dice, and unwind in taverns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/eb48e18607b79889f16507453457a354.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1150 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join a guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain a lone wanderer or join one of three guilds.  Each guild unlocks new quests and events. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/cf9fcbbde85701439f10aad3e010e2a1.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine and upgrade your gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique pieces of equipment designed for combat across different biomes.  Experiment with builds and discover powerful synergies. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/ec61a5c87986118ac8e6dc6173c35c0d.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Path autosaves your progress and fits naturally into short sessions — though you'll probably end up staying for one more fight anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck, hero!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world awaits a hero — choose your own.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any NPC can become the chosen one. Explore a living, procedurally generated hex-based world, forge your own path, build unique combinations of weapons, tools, and relics, and crush hordes of enemies in fast-paced combat.  No two runs are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set out on a journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world full of secrets and random encounters, inspired by classic RPGs.  Five distinct biomes, each with its own visual style and enemies, make every journey unpredictable. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/eba13514614a1de7a895d965bf6696e3.avif?t=1787756734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras_big/eba13514614a1de7a895d965bf6696e3.avif?t=1787756734 width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique cities and villages, filled with quirky inhabitants and their own stories. Take on small tasks, play dice, and unwind in taverns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/eb48e18607b79889f16507453457a354.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1150 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join a guild</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain a lone wanderer or join one of three guilds.  Each guild unlocks new quests and events. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/cf9fcbbde85701439f10aad3e010e2a1.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine and upgrade your gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique pieces of equipment designed for combat across different biomes.  Experiment with builds and discover powerful synergies. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/extras/ec61a5c87986118ac8e6dc6173c35c0d.avif?t=1787756734\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Path autosaves your progress and fits naturally into short sessions — though you'll probably end up staying for one more fight anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck, hero!</strong></p>", "short_description": "The world needs a hero — choose yours. Any NPC can become the chosen one. Explore a living, procedurally generated hex world, carve your own path, craft unique combinations of weapons, tools, and relics, and fight through relentless hordes in fast-paced combat. Every run is different.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/1417e83fb8069e9346d43d4cec1e507e55e4ff57/header.jpg?t=1787756734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/fe60283b1d22c23419d8e874201590f1ab504417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787756734", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4668470/fe60283b1d22c23419d8e874201590f1ab504417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787756734", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 or AMD Ryzen 2500U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct3D 12 or Vulkan 1.0 compatible GPU</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 13.0 Ventura or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU with Metal 3 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 18 and later<